@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:18080
@memberToken = 替换为买家登录返回的token
@adminToken = 替换为管理员登录返回的token
@devKey = 替换为本地开发密钥

# 本文件为逐步手工演示；将响应中的ID和业务号填入后续请求。
# 所有金额均为整数分。不要把真实凭证保存或提交到仓库。


@orderNo = 替换为已付款订单号
@shipmentNo = 替换为运单业务号
@afterSaleNo = 替换为售后单号
@refundNo = 替换为退款单号

### 整单发货
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/v1/orders/{{orderNo}}/shipment
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"carrier":"模拟快递","trackingNo":"learning-send-001"}

### 等待运单不再为 CREATING 后注入轨迹
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/v1/orders/{{orderNo}}/shipment
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 修改 eventTime 为演示时间；同事件号不能代表不同事件
POST {{baseUrl}}/dev/v1/shipments/{{shipmentNo}}/tracks
X-Dev-Key: {{devKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"eventId":"learning-delivered-001","eventTime":"2026-11-11T08:00:00Z","status":"DELIVERED","description":"已签收"}

### 买家确认收货，物流签收不会自动调用此接口
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderNo}}/receipt
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}

### 7 天内申请整单售后
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/after-sales
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"orderNo":"{{orderNo}}","reason":"学习退货退款"}

### 管理员审核
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/v1/after-sales/{{afterSaleNo}}/review
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"approved":true,"reason":"同意退货"}

### 买家填写退货运单
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/after-sales/{{afterSaleNo}}/return
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"carrier":"模拟快递","trackingNo":"learning-return-001"}

### 后台收到退货，触发异步退款
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/v1/after-sales/{{afterSaleNo}}/accept-return
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 轮询售后 COMPLETED，取得 refundNo
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/after-sales/{{afterSaleNo}}
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}

### 检查到账及退款金额
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/refunds/{{refundNo}}
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}
